# The decoder map against random-mapping nulls (ca-swarm-f)

N = 1000000 samples, T = 300 steps. H2 = -log2 of the unbiased collision probability among the N samples (">" = no collision: above the resolution 2 log2 N - 1), H_inf = -log2(max share).

